    "languages": [],
    "summaryAr": "About Omni Omni is the AI analytics platform that turns company data into a trusted source of truth for AI. Built on a semantic model, Omni gives teams a governed context graph, so everyone gets the same trusted answer. Ask in plain English, refine in workbooks, or bring your data into tools like Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, and Slack. Our team has spent decades building data platforms, and we started Omni to fix problem",
    "descriptionAr": "About Omni Omni is the AI analytics platform that turns company data into a trusted source of truth for AI. Built on a semantic model, Omni gives teams a governed context graph, so everyone gets the same trusted answer. Ask in plain English, refine in workbooks, or bring your data into tools like Claude, ChatGPT, Cursor, and Slack. Our team has spent decades building data platforms, and we started Omni to fix problems we saw firsthand. Today, we help customers like Condé Nast, BambooHR, and Synthesia get better answers from their data. We're headquartered in San Francisco and have raised $217M from top investors including ICONIQ, Theory Ventures, and Redpoint Ventures. Our latest $120M Series C valued us at $1.5B. If you like helping people get more from their data, come build with us. We’d love to hear from you. About the Role We love helping companies make better decisions and build new products with data. Since launching for commercial availability in 2023, we’ve built an innovative base of customers across almost every industry who trust our product and team. As we continue our growth journey, we’re looking for sales pioneers to help us take Omni to the next level. This is where you come in. Our BDRs are strategic and critical team players, who are responsible for identifying new business opportunities by prospecting and qualifying new customers and partners. You’ll be an integral part of the growth engine by creating and managing early funnel opportunities. You’ll work cross-functionally with sales and marketing to design, iterate, and execute unique and innovative go-to-market campaigns with a high sense of urgency. We believe in promoting from within and helping you shape your career path ensuring growth in your sales profession. Responsibilities Become an Omni expert and deeply understand our competitor landscape. Drive top of funnel for and with our account executive team. You will run campaigns across email, LinkedIn, and other channels to drive pipeline. Accelerate conversion of warm and inactive prospects. Craft thoughtful copy that articulates the unique value Omni creates. Constantly innovate and push the envelope, moving beyond typical B2B marketing playbooks to unlock scale and ROI. Say ‘yes’. We’re building fast and we’re looking for teammates who share and step up to new opportunities. About You 1+ years of experience in business development. Ability to navigate through ambiguity. You know where we need to go, but recognize it won’t always be a straight path to get there. A willingness to fall forward. You bring and test ideas — even if it means don’t always land perfectly, but you iterate and try again. Strong attention to detail. You can dive into the weeds with the team and pick up on the seemingly small, yet important, details. AI Literacy Why Join Us Passionate, supportive team with extensive experience in the space (including founders from Looker and Stitch Data) all working together to win as a team Health, dental, and vision insurance 401(k) Plan (for US-based roles) Unlimited PTO Omni is an equal opportunity employer. We value diversity and encourage you to apply even if you don’t check every single box. Please, let us know if you need any reasonable accommodations during the interview process.",
